# Security headers for every page and file (Netlify's _headers). The build
# replaces the Content-Security-Policy line below with the full policy, which
# allows each inline script and style of the built pages by its hash
# (scripts/write-csp.mts); check:pages checks it covers them all.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; form-action 'self'
